  "description": "Experience the Joy of Mobility with Dexter Jr.\n\nIntroducing the Dexter Jr., the compact Emojo electric trike that makes riding a breeze! Perfect for individuals seeking an easy, comfortable, and stable way to enjoy everyday travel, this electric trike transforms your errands into fun outdoor adventures. With its low step-through frame and ergonomic Harley-style handlebars, you can glide effortlessly through your neighborhood or run errands with style.\n\nFully assembled and ready to roll, the Dexter Jr. allows you to hit the road without the hassle of complicated setups. Available in four stylish colors, this electric trike combines aesthetics with practicality to cater to your unique sense of style.\n\nKey Highlights:\n\nPowerful 500W brushless motor for smooth rides\n\nTop speed of 20 MPH and an impressive 60-mile battery range\n\nAluminum alloy frame ensures durability and stability\n\nDesigned for riders weighing up to 300 lbs\n\nFully assembled and ready for instant use\n\nDon't miss out on this chance to redefine your travel experience. With the Dexter Jr., commuting becomes a pleasurable journey. Make this electric trike a part of your daily routine and turn every ride into a memorable experience!",
